[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0306","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0306.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0730","title":"Apache HTTP Server 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Apache 1.3.20 split-logfile 组件在 HTTP 请求的 Host 头字段处理中存在安全漏洞，攻击者可通过在 Host 头中包含 '/'（斜杠）字符绕过文件扩展名验证，向目标系统运行的所有以 .log 结尾的日志文件中写入任意内容，破坏日志文件的完整性和机密性。该漏洞影响所有运行 Apache 1.3.20 版本的服务，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发，仅需发送包含恶意 Host 头字段的 HTTP 请求即可利用此漏洞写入恶意数据，可能导致文件权限异常、敏感信息泄露或其他安全威胁，对系统日志审计造成严重破坏。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0730"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-10-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:51Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 1.3.21 或更高版本（如 2.0.x 分支），该版本修复了 split-logfile 中的 Host 头斜杠路径遍历漏洞；若无法立即升级，可在前端反向代理（如 Nginx/Apache mod_proxy）层面拦截包含斜杠的 Host 头（如 `Host: example.com/..`），或在 Apache 配置中启用 `UseCanonicalName On` 并限制 `Host` 头格式，同时限制 split-logfile 脚本的写入权限至专用日志目录。建议优先升级至 Apache 2.4.x 长期支持版本。建议升级到 Apache 2.4.58 或更高版本。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面拦截包含斜杠的 Host 头请求，或在 Apache 配置中添加 `SetEnvIf Host \"^[^/]*$\" valid_host` 并配合 `Deny from env=!valid_host` 限制非法 Host 头，同时限制 split-logfile 脚本写入权限至指定日志目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000430","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2001:077","http://www.apacheweek.com/issues/01-09-28#security","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1649.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-126.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-164.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7419","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5419c9ba0951ef73a655362403d12bb8d10fab38274deb3f005816f5%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf2f0f3611f937cf6cfb3b4fe4a67f69885855126110e1e3f2fb2728e%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf6449464fd8b7437704c55f88361b66f12d5b5f90bcce66af4be4ba9%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0730.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/20ad1fe1013ca96ea2384f289b4316baeb76e2fc/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0730.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0730","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/httpd-vulnerabilities/blob/b71e143e670cd0a24ad5402f3d46c0ba20429842/cves/CVE-2001-0730.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/88dff62b57cbb639f2b0714fb489ef14e49d5b06/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0730.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x7jp-wrv8-52h3/GHSA-x7jp-wrv8-52h3.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0730.md","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/0xxx/cve-2001-0730.yaml","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4688662f-dcd5-440b-be03-c4789b291666.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0306.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0285","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0285.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0669","title":"Cisco Secure IDS等多款IDS产品 编码IIS攻击检测绕过漏洞","description":"该漏洞影响多种厂商和版本的入侵检测系统（IDS）设备，包括Cisco Secure IDS 2.0/3.0、Cisco Catalyst 6000入侵检测系统模块、Dragon Sensor 4.x、Snort 1.x（低于1.8.1版本）、ISS RealSecure网络传感器5.x和6.x（XPU 3.2之前）、ISS RealSecure服务器传感器5.5和6.0（Windows版）。漏洞原理是这些系统中存在一种检测逃避机制，攻击者可以通过向目标系统发送包含非标准\"%u\" Unicode编码的ASCII字符的URL来构造HTTP攻击请求，从而触发本漏洞，实现对攻击流量的检测逃避。该漏洞影响范围广泛，涵盖了多个主流IDS平台，为攻击者提供了绕过安全监测系统的机会。攻击条件方面，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，攻击者只需向目标系统发送特制的数据包或构造包含Unicode编码的URL即可触发漏洞而无需任何前置条件。这意味着攻击者可以在不具备任何权限或认证的情况下远程控制目标IDS系统。此外，由于IDS设备通常部署在网络边界，具有监控和过滤大量网络流量的能力，一旦被此漏洞影响，将导致攻击者能够直接绕过这些安全设备，进入更深层次的网络环境，最终可能导致数据泄露、系统破坏或更严重的网络安全事件。因此，尽管此漏洞属于检测逃避类问题，但其潜在影响非常严重，可能导致整个网络安全防御体系失效，攻击者可以更从容地实施进一步的攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0669"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:43Z","remediation":"建议立即升级受影响的 IDS 产品：Snort 升级至 1.8.1 或更高版本，ISS RealSecure 升级至 XPU 3.2 或更高版本，Cisco Secure IDS 升级至厂商发布的最新补丁版本。同时在 Web 应用防火墙或反向代理层面启用 Unicode 解码规则（如 %u 编码解码、UTF-8 规范化），并在 IDS 规则集中添加针对非标准 Unicode 编码的检测规则（如 Snort 规则 sid:1002 等）。若无法立即升级，可在边界防火墙配置规则拦截包含 %u 编码的 HTTP 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99972950200602&w=2","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/cisco-intrusion-detection-obfuscation-vuln-pub.shtml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/548515","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3292","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise95.php","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21100","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0669.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0669.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0669","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0669.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0669.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5xc8-p2x4-cp2p/GHSA-5xc8-p2x4-cp2p.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_500_600.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cc89edc4-0825-4233-a7f1-40e75eeaf80d.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0669.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0285.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0283","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0283.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0664","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5 安全区域欺骗漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 和 5.01 存在安全区域欺骗漏洞，远程攻击者可通过包含无点 IP 地址的畸形 URL 绕过安全限制，欺骗 Internet Explorer 将页面处理为 Intranet 区域（内部网络区域），该区域安全限制较低，从而绕过安全限制执行恶意代码。该漏洞影响 IE 5.5 和 5.01 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，属高危漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，只需诱导用户访问包含畸形 URL 的恶意页面即可触发漏洞。Microsoft 已发布 MS01-055 安全公告修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0664"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:42Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Internet Explorer 6.0 并安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-055 (KB313675) 补丁。若无法升级，可在 IE 安全设置中将\"本地 Intranet 区域\"安全级别设为\"高\"，并取消勾选\"自动检测 Intranet 网络\"作为临时缓解措施。强烈建议升级至现代浏览器（Edge/Chrome/Firefox）彻底规避该漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100281551611595&w=2","http://morph3us.org/blog/?p=31","http://www.osvdb.org/1971","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3420","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-051","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7258","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21118","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0664.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0664","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0664.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0664.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-35hr-3jc6-7qrp/GHSA-35hr-3jc6-7qrp.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0724.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0664.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0283.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0283.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0279","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0279.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0652","title":"Sun Solaris xlock 堆溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.6 至 8 版本（x86 架构）的 xlock 程序存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过设置过长的 XFILESEARCHPATH 或 XUSERFILESEARCHPATH 环境变量触发堆溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.6 至 8 的 x86 版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用方式为设置超长环境变量触发堆溢出实现权限提升至 root，CVSS 评分 7.2（本地访问、低复杂度、无需认证、完全影响机密性/完整性/可用性）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0652"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:41Z","remediation":"立即应用 Sun Solaris 8 补丁 111585-01 (x86) 或升级至 Solaris 8 更新 7 及以上版本。若无法立即打补丁，可执行 chmod -s /usr/openwin/bin/xlock 移除 xlock 的 setuid 位，或通过限制本地用户登录权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99745571104126&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3160","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6967","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A10","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A131","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21059","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0652.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0652.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0652","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0652.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0652.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j3w4-jrr4-3qpc/GHSA-j3w4-jrr4-3qpc.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0652.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0eae9e93-78d4-41e8-8b82-0bbf0884af81.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0279.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0502","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0502.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1384","title":"Linux Kernel Ptrace/Setuid Exec 权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux内核2.2.x至2.2.19及2.4.x至2.4.9版本中存在ptrace权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在setuid/setgid程序（如newgrp）上调用ptrace，利用其调用非特权程序时的权限提升机制，劫持控制流获取root权限。该漏洞影响Linux内核2.2和2.4早期版本，CVSS评分7.2（高危），攻击向量为本地，低攻击复杂度，无需认证即可完全控制系统机密性、完整性和可用性。攻击者需具备本地账户权限，通过ptrace附加到setuid程序，在其执行非特权子进程时实现提权。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1384"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:09Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.20 或 2.4.10 及以上版本（如 Red Hat 7.1 更新内核至 kernel-2.4.9-31 或更高版本）。若无法立即升级内核，可通过设置内核参数 kernel.yama.ptrace_scope=1 限制 ptrace 权限，或移除非必要的 setuid/setgid 程序权限位作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-035-01","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100343090106914&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100350685431610&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/3713","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7311.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-079.php3","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-082.php3","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1650.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_036_kernel_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-129.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-130.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3447","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21124","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2001/CVE-2001-1384.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1384.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-