"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:57Z","remediation":"升级到 Internet Software Solutions Air Messenger LAN Server 最新版本，修复版本已发布。下载地址：https://www.internetsoftware.com/products/amlserver/。安装后重启服务生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0228.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2881","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20934","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0ff539514ffae70ea73031a227022cb4e6068a50/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0788.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0788","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e10c449b2000a2439910055eb21748030356eb7d/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0788.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e8cef73228affbb0d7f27f3d9e33baf98c2660a4/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0788.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/734adcc0a68fbe95325e836d2469be64740b89d7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m7h7-j2x5-9v3x/GHSA-m7h7-j2x5-9v3x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0788.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0354.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0354.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0354.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0351","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0351.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0782","title":"KDE KTVision 文件覆盖漏洞","description":"KDE KTVision 0.1.1-271 及更早版本存在本地文件覆盖漏洞，攻击者可通过符号链接（symlink）将用户配置文件指向系统敏感文件，当应用程序写入配置时实际覆盖系统关键文件，从而获得 root 权限并完全控制系统。该漏洞影响 KDE 桌面环境下运行 KTVision 0.1 至 0.1.1-271 版本的 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备目标主机的本地用户访问权限，利用该漏洞可绕过权限限制直接获取最高管理员权限，危害等级严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0782"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:56Z","remediation":"建议升级 KDE KTVision 至 0.1.1-272 或更高版本，或升级到 KDE 2.2.2 及以上版本。临时缓解措施：限制普通用户对 /tmp 目录的写入权限，或设置 sticky bit 防止符号链接攻击（chmod +t /tmp），同时限制用户对配置文件目录的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0302.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6741","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20961","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0782.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0782","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0782.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/aa5f2f0cb1791a7f76244bf9f9a0c7e17c4a2f8d/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0782.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3q6v-jv77-fpxc/GHSA-3q6v-jv77-fpxc.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x90000/89078/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0782.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a074c872-06e6-43ca-8e04-a5be47a63845.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0351.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0349","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0349.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0780","title":"Cosmicperl Directory Pro 目录遍历漏洞","description":"这是一个目录遍历安全漏洞，存在于 Cosmicperl Directory Pro 2.0 软件的 cosmicpro.cgi 脚本中。该脚本未能正确验证用户输入的 SHOW 参数，攻击者可通过在参数中嵌入“..”目录遍历符号，绕过应用程序验证，访问服务器上的任意文件。这可能导致数据库凭证、源代码、用户凭据等敏感信息泄露。漏洞性质为 CVSS 5.0 标准（攻击面：网络，复杂性：低，认证：无，机密性影响：部分）。受影响系统包括 Cosmicperl Directory Pro 2.0 及使用相同目录服务软件的组织。攻击者无需任何权限即可远程触发此漏洞，获取目标服务器文件系统中的敏感数据。通过这种漏洞，攻击者不仅可以窃取身份信息，还可能进一步开展身份欺骗、系统控制等更高级别的攻击。该漏洞已通过安全更新修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0780"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:56Z","remediation":"建议立即停用或删除 Cosmicperl Directory Pro 2.0 中的 cosmicpro.cgi 脚本，或升级至官方发布的修复版本（如有）。若无法升级，请在 Web 服务器层面配置规则拦截包含 \"../\" 的 SHOW 参数请求，并在 CGI 脚本中添加输入验证过滤目录遍历序列，同时限制 Web 服务器进程对敏感目录的读取权限作为临时缓解措施。建议迁移至现代维护的目录程序替代该旧版本程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/187182","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2793","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20887","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0780.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0780","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0780.md","https://github.com/CPAN-Security/cpan-advisory-database/blob/bc9ed2336eeed09f48acb0a64fd37970dc5a31d6/triage/CVE-2001-0780.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0780.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8xg9-rqqm-wr86/GHSA-8xg9-rqqm-wr86.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0780.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/directorypro.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2793/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0780.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0349.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0348","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0348.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0779","title":"SCO OpenServer HP-UX Sun Solaris rpc.yppasswdd 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.6/7/8、OpenServer 5.0.5/5.0.6 及 HP-UX 10/11 的 rpc.yppasswdd (yppasswd 服务) 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送超长用户名参数触发栈溢出，进而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0 (CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H)，属远程代码执行高危漏洞，影响多款主流 Unix 系统默认开启的 NIS 密码修改服务，攻击者无需认证即可远程获取根权限。ExploitDB (EDB-20879) 及 GitHub 多个仓库已公开 PoC 利用代码，建议升级至修复版本或禁用 rpc.yppasswdd 服务。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0779"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:56Z","remediation":"立即从厂商官网获取并安装针对 CVE-2001-0779 的安全补丁：Solaris 2.6/7/8 安装 Sun Alert 209 补丁（如 106476-02、106950-04、108992-02）、OpenServer 5.0.5/5.0.6 升级至 5.0.7 并应用 SCO 安全公告补丁、HP-UX 10/11 安装 PHSS_18783/PHSS_21667 补丁。若无法立即打补丁，立即停止 rpc.yppasswdd 服务并禁用 NIS 密码修改功能，同时在防火墙上封锁 UDP/TCP 端口 635（yppasswdd 端口）阻断远程攻击面。建议迁移至受支持的现代操作系统版本彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/209","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/m-008.shtml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/327281","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/187086","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/200110041632.JAA28125%40dim.ucsd.edu","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2763","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6629","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A102","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A56","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20879","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0779.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0779.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0779","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/2025.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0779.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0779.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-36j3-pwc5-6487/GHSA-36j3-pwc5-6487.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/d238d5bce44b90604ce028c0619c664802195051/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/bailehang/snort_2.2.0/blob/34f8a3a85f15645aea53d6e0d46863c7c57e43ef/doc/signatures/2030.txt","https://github.com/chamara84/snort-2.9_RTDS/blob/893942516b660280cc187ddf79d13fca72df6a20/snort-2.9.14.1/doc/signatures/2026.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0348.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0346","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0346.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0905","title":"Procmail邮件处理工具信号处理竞态条件漏洞","description":"procmail 3.20 及更早版本在以 setuid root 权限运行时，其信号处理机制存在竞争条件漏洞。本地攻击者可在信号处理程序正在执行时发送特定信号，触发竞争条件导致内存破坏或权限提升，从而导致拒绝服务或获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响所有以 setuid root 方式运行 procmail 3.20 及更早版本的 Unix/Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地账户权限并能精确控制信号发送时机才能利用。攻击者通过精心安排信号发送时机，在信号处理程序重入时破坏程序状态，实现权限提升或导致进程崩溃拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0905"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:11Z","remediation":"升级 procmail 到 3.22 或更高版本（procmail 3.22 于 2001 年发布已修复该竞态条件）。Debian 用户可执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install procmail` 升级至 3.22-1 或更高版本；Red Hat 系列可用 `rpm -Uvh procmail-3.22-*.rpm` 升级。若无法立即升级，可临时移除 procmail 的 setuid 位：`chmod u-s /usr/bin/procmail` 作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快从官方源或 http://www.procmail.org/ 下载最新版本编译安装。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000433","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-083","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-085.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-093.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3071","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6872","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0905.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0905","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0905.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0905.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-083.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-gjq2-7fjr-x6vv/GHSA-gjq2-7fjr-x6vv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0905.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_100_200.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nislab/threat-knowledge-graph/blob/8c04b3ea5fdf2c05a8f9866d95a35111f7844c16/preprocess/database_preprocessing.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0346.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0345","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0345.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0778","title":"Omnicron OmniHTTPd 文件源代码泄露漏洞","description":"Omnicron OmniHTTPd 2.0.8 及更早版本存在源代码泄露漏洞，攻击者可通过发送包含 URL 编码空格符 (%20) 的 GET 请求，绕过服务器的脚本执行机制直接获取服务器端脚本源代码。该漏洞影响 OmniHTTPd 2.0.4 至 2.0.8 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，仅需构造包含 %20 的恶意 URL 即可获取服务端脚本源码，可能导致敏感信息泄露、业务逻辑泄露等安全风险。攻击者可利用该漏洞获取服务端脚本源代码，进而分析业务逻辑漏洞、数据库连接信息等敏感内容，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0778"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:56Z","remediation":"建议立即迁移至现代维护中的 Web 服务器（如 Apache、Nginx 或 IIS 最新版），OmniHTTPd 2.0.8 及更早版本已停止维护且无官方补丁。临时缓解措施：在 Web 应用防火墙或反向代理层配置规则拦截包含 %20 的 URL 请求，或在 Web 服务器配置中禁用 URL 编码空格解析功能，同时限制对敏感源码目录的直接访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0248.html","http://www.omnicron.ca/httpd/docs/release.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6621","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20886","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0778.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0778","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0778.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0778.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/OmniHTTPd%E6%BA%90%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E8%8E%B7%E5%BE%97%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2001-0778).html","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0778.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/Omnihttpd_pro_source_disclosure.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_600_700.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0778.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0345.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0342","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0342.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0766","title":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.14 Mac OS X 文件保护绕过漏洞","description":"Apache 1.3.14 在 MacOS X Client 10.0.3 系统（使用 HFS+ 文件系统）上存在漏洞。由于 HFS+ 文件系统不区分大小写，而 Apache 的过滤器未正确处理 URL 中字符的大小写差异，远程攻击者可通过发送包含特定大小写变体字符的 URL 请求，绕过 Apache 的访问控制限制，访问受保护的文件资源。攻击条件为：目标运行 Apache 1.3.14 且基于 MacOS X 10.0.3 HFS+ 文件系统，攻击者可远程构造恶意 URL 绕过访问控制，CVSS 9.8 级严重漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0766"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:55Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 1.3.15 或更高版本（已修复 HFS+ 大小写不敏感绕过问题），或升级 MacOS X Client 至 10.0.4 及以上版本。若暂时无法升级，可在 httpd.conf 中添加 \"CheckCaseOnly on\" 和 \"CheckSpelling Off\" 指令禁用大小写不敏感匹配，或在 Apache 配置中显式设置文件系统大小写敏感选项。临时缓解措施：在 Web 应用防火墙层面拦截包含大小写变体的恶意 URL 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0090.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2852","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20911","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0766.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0766","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0766.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0766.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3vgv-pgwc-8f57/GHSA-3vgv-pgwc-8f57.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/high/MacOS%20X%20Client%20Apache%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2001-0766).html","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/0xxx/cve-2001-0766.yaml","https://github.com/sdnewhop/grinder/blob/7432531e4a5a4ce3cc8224ac852188ef1d18432d/samples/062019-f5-bigip-hashes/csv/vulnerability.csv","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_100_200.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0342.toml"}]